    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d900">

                <pb facs="1043" n="963" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg963"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Senor Ojeda.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington-</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-12-12"><hi rendition="#italic">December 12,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 20.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to your note of the 5th ultimo,
                    complaining of the arrest of the master of the Spanish steamship <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Leonora</hi> and the searching of his vessel by the
                    municipal police at Pensacola, I have the honor to inclose copy of a letter to
                    the governor of Florida from the mayor of Pensacola stating the circumstances as
                    reported to him.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John Hay.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d900-a1.xml" xpointer="d900-a1"/>
            </div>
